{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/ozml8n6t","slide":2,"bbox":[76,240,10,10]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/p0v2hs7e","slide":2,"text":"ANSEI production data still sits outside SAP, with Excel used for reporting and handoffs.","textPreview":"ANSEI production data still sits outside SAP, with Excel used for reporting and handoffs.","textChars":89,"textLines":1,"bbox":[98,232,464,70]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/i10jut8j","slide":2,"bbox":[76,352,10,10]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/329k3yp4","slide":2,"text":"Teams have to reconcile separate records, and SAP has no complete view of ANSEI material and finished goods movements.","textPreview":"Teams have to reconcile separate records, and SAP has no complete view of ANSEI material and finished goods movements.","textChars":118,"textLines":1,"bbox":[98,344,464,92]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zmlcnm1s","slide":2,"text":"What changed","textPreview":"What changed","textChars":12,"textLines":1,"bbox":[678,166,480,42]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/ylcbeh07","slide":2,"bbox":[678,240,10,10]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lo3upcji","slide":2,"text":"IT and Accounting tested the ANSEI scenario in SAP. SAP can handle it with the right ownership and valuation setup.","textPreview":"IT and Accounting tested the ANSEI scenario in SAP. SAP can handle it with the right ownership and valuation setup.","textChars":115,"textLines":1,"bbox":[700,232,478,92]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/0nudgrix","slide":2,"bbox":[678,372,10,10]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ri1cj21g","slide":2,"text":"NOVA can run the shopfloor process while SAP records the actual business transactions.","textPreview":"NOVA can run the shopfloor process while SAP records the actual business transactions.","textChars":86,"textLines":1,"bbox":[700,364,478,70]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/qxsbaxkv","slide":2,"bbox":[138,526,1004,106]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dkjulcjm","slide":2,"text":"What we need from management","textPreview":"What we need from management","textChars":28,"textLines":1,"bbox":[174,546,380,32]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cjatc721","slide":2,"text":"Support Production's formal request to Accounting so the SAP design can move forward.","textPreview":"Support Production's formal request to Accounting so the SAP design can move forward.","textChars":85,"textLines":1,"bbox":[174,584,902,34]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/3u1cf21k","slide":2,"bbox":[64,681,1152,0]}
